  "scope": "Full text of all128 entries from the recorded candidate extraction was read. This is not proof of exhaustive note extraction, referenced-guide coverage or completed patch/controller/client assessment.",
  "categories": {
    "CAPABILITY_DISCOVERY": "Disabled DC/Build/ImageRegistry capabilities require discovery/offline diagnostics or harness prerequisites; no automatic capability enablement.",
    "API_VERSION_REMOVALS": "CSIStorageCapacityv1beta1 is outside both inventories; stable workload APIs retained.",
    "SCC_PSA": "Required-SCC authorization/default guards and Pod server dry run address admission; namespace policy changes remain point-in-time.",
    "PDB": "Use policy/v1 selectors and synchronized disruption status before controller scaling; no eviction API or changed eviction policy is emitted.",
    "HARDWARE_RUNTIME": "Device-plugin/CPU-manager/NUMA and kernel behavior is a runtime limitation; DRA-specific kubelet plugin APIs are not called. Patch/hardware guidance remains to correlate.",
    "EXTERNAL_NETWORK": "No host/router/security-group or dual-stack configuration changes; endpoint identity and explicit application health still need runtime validation.",
    "ADMIN_POLICY": "Identified missing ANP/BANP label assessment; guard93efcf3 plus actual regression exercises pre-retirement refusal. Optional capabilities, not a raised baseline API requirement.",
    "CSI_MIGRATION": "Storage plugin removals with CSI migration require functioning external drivers; existing claim/PV references preserved. Distinct from CephFS/RBD with no migration path. Detailed driver/patch assumptions pending.",
    "DC_DEPRECATION": "DC remains served; warnings are informational, unavailable API fails explicitly, exported input stays usable.",
    "ACCESS_REVIEW": "Caller SSAR plus actual operation errors; no assumption that an allowed preliminary review guarantees later authorization.",
    "DC_SCALE_WEBHOOK": "Production modifies full DC specs and does not call DC scale subresource; harness/controller prerequisites can still fail visibly.",
    "IMAGE_BUILD_RUNTIME": "Preserve image references/triggers; unresolved images block planning. Registry/mirror/build infrastructure remains a runtime/harness prerequisite.",
    "REMOVED_LEGACY_STORAGE_GUARD": "Automatic CephFS migration is refused across the supported range; no claim of legacy driver mountability.",
    "SERVICE_CONTRACT": "Production retains Services and does not allocate/release addresses, rewrite appProtocol or remove finalizers; harness uses stable core/v1 setup.",
    "QUOTA_ACCOUNTING_REVIEW": "Existing accounting uses admitted requests/allocations and synchronized quotas; detailed field and upstream patch correlation remains pending.",
    "NAME_WARNING": "New DNS-label warnings are informational; server validation and conversion errors remain failures.",
    "HPA_METRICS": "autoscaling/v2 and container names/spec retained. Feature-disabled container metrics can remain degraded; no promise of metrics-controller readiness. Detailed HPA controller review pending.",
    "AUTH_TOKEN_REVIEW": "Credentials are opaque to the production client; legacy Secret cleanup and bound-token behavior need the cross-release authentication disposition.",
    "CLIENT_LIBRARY_REVIEW": "No direct BackoffManager call in production; maintained-client decision and transitive behavior review remain pending.",
    "GRPC_PROBE": "Preserve baseline gRPC probe configuration; kubelet performs probing, while explicit CLI application health uses the planned HTTP URL.",
    "INFRA_UI_OBSERVABILITY": "Installer/hosted-control-plane/operator/UI/logging/metrics/admin-flag changes are outside converter operations. Host-network placement requires manual review; no infrastructure or controller-manager reconfiguration."
  },
